shmates, un borves un naket. geven azoy vi in dzhungl.

222
00:10:50,678 --> 00:10:52,248
un zey hobn aykh gezogt

223
00:10:52,248 --> 00:10:57,828
ir kont tsurik, e- ets vet a mol kenen keyn Yisroel kumen tsi nisht, tsi m'hot epes geredt tsu aykh

224
00:10:55,504 --> 00:10:58,586
dos veys ikh nisht. mir hot men gornisht gezogt.

225
00:10:58,963 --> 00:11:02,115
m'hot NUR gevart oyf di kvotes, vayl yede monat

226
00:11:02,115 --> 00:11:04,289
hobn gekent dray hundert mentshn

227
00:11:04,482 --> 00:11:05,741
AUSREISEN.

228
00:11:06,608 --> 00:11:09,082
un az, ven ikh darf vartn

229
00:11:09,848 --> 00:11:13,082
oyf di dray hundert, volt ikh gedarft blaybn dort dray yor.

230
00:11:14,792 --> 00:11:16,726
azoy ikh bin geforn mit di

231
00:11:17,205 --> 00:11:19,202
kinder unter draytsn yor.

232
00:11:19,202 --> 00:11:22,464
hot men undz gebrengt in Yi- in Yisroel in a lager

233
00:11:22,842 --> 00:11:26,278
UNK nokh geven England, nokh nisht geven Yisroel

234
00:11:27,972 --> 00:11:29,513
vu hot men aykh gebrakht?

235
00:11:28,022 --> 00:11:29,180
nu hot men undz

236
00:11:29,220 --> 00:11:30,125
vos?

237
00:11:29,513 --> 00:11:31,898
vu ahin iz geven vu m'hot aykh gebrakht?

238
00:11:31,802 --> 00:11:37,466
dos ershte iz geven di STADT ATLIT. dort iz geven aza zaml lager BEVOR

239
00:11:37,472 --> 00:11:39,541
un fun dort hot men ersht

240
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:41,533
geshikt vayter.

241
00:11:41,961 --> 00:11:43,578
⟨zenen mir gan⟩ in KIBUTSIM

242
00:11:43,578 --> 00:11:45,043
vu hobn mir gekent geyn?

243
00:11:45,505 --> 00:11:47,608
zent ir vu ahin gegangen?

244
00:11:47,698 --> 00:11:51,674
in a KI- in a KIBUTS vos iz nokh geven

245
00:11:51,850 --> 00:11:55,421
eyder zey geyen aroys oyf zeyer

246
00:11:55,444 --> 00:11:56,450
BODEN

247
00:11:56,592 --> 00:11:58,141
zenen mir undz geven

248
00:11:58,141 --> 00:12:00,500
alts yugnt dort. m'hot gangen

249
00:12:00,507 --> 00:12:05,217
a halbn tog hobn mir gelernt, a halbn tog hobn mir gearbet, oykh a religyezer KIBUTS.

250
00:12:05,217 --> 00:12:07,047
s'hot geheysn YESODOT.

251
00:12:07,695 --> 00:12:10,304
haynt iz dos a dorf, a MOSHAV

252
00:12:11,070 --> 00:12:12,447
un dan hot

253
00:12:12,522 --> 00:12:14,288
ho- iz gevorn

254
00:12:15,627 --> 00:12:17,831
UM ACHTUNVIERZIG

255
00:12:18,478 --> 00:12:19,721
Yisroel

256
00:12:19,997 --> 00:12:21,695
glaykh ongehoybn krig.

257
00:12:22,174 --> 00:12:23,940
glaykh hot men bashosn

258
00:12:24,655 --> 00:12:27,383
un m'hot bashosn undzer KIBUTS

259
00:12:27,422 --> 00:12:28,715
UNK

260
00:12:28,924 --> 00:12:31,734
di barakn zenen geven mit di ale zakhn

261
00:12:31,734 --> 00:12:34,484
iz ales farbrent gevorn. ikh bin geven oyfn feld

262
00:12:34,484 --> 00:12:35,837
bin ikh vider a mol

263
00:12:36,096 --> 00:12:37,147
geblibn

264
00:12:37,147 --> 00:12:38,671
NUR mit mayne

265
00:12:38,931 --> 00:12:42,519
zakhn oyf mir. s'hot ales farbrent. ikh hob gornisht gehat.

266
00:12:42,711 --> 00:12:44,038
nokh hot ongehoybn

267
00:12:44,095 --> 00:12:45,945
dos mit militer

268
00:12:46,170 --> 00:12:48,504
zenen zikh ale tselofn in militer.

269
00:12:48,504 --> 00:12:54,027
un NACHn militer iz keyner mer nit tsurikgekumen in ⟨di⟩ KIBUTS. yeder iz zikh tsekrokhn.

270
00:12:54,203 --> 00:12:56,579
ven ir zent geven in dem KIBUTS

271
00:12:56,579 --> 00:12:57,639
hot ir

272
00:12:57,645 --> 00:13:02,414
gehat kontakt mit di mume in Rusland, in Rumenye, tsi

273
00:13:00,109 --> 00:13:01,166
neyn.

274
00:13:01,375 --> 00:13:04,274
key- neyn. nisht gehat kontakt, vayl

275
00:13:04,274 --> 00:13:07,696
s'iz shoyn geven ABGESCHNITTEN. ikh'hob, fleg NUR bakumen

276
00:13:08,192 --> 00:13:09,941
ALSO NACHTRICHTEN.

277
00:13:11,010 --> 00:13:13,332
der groyser bruder iz mit aykh geven?

278
00:13:13,272 --> 00:13:13,806
i-

279
00:13:13,963 --> 00:13:19,203
nisht mit mir tsuzamen. ikh bin gekumen a monat friert, bin ikh, hot mir geshikt ahin.

280
00:13:19,203 --> 00:13:21,063
er iz gekumen a monat shpeter

281
00:13:21,388 --> 00:13:28,182
un ikh hob eyn mol gevolt im bazukhn, iz shoyn geven geferlekh, vayl m'ho- m'hot nisht gekent farbayforn di arabishe derfer

282
00:13:28,645 --> 00:13:30,208
iz shoyn geven krig.

283
00:13:32,323 --> 00:13:36,434
azoy, er iz gegangen in militer far mir, vayl er iz elter fun mir

284
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:39,067
azoy undz ze'mir nisht geven tsuzamen

285
00:13:39,242 --> 00:13:40,454
eyn TAG.

286
00:13:40,454 --> 00:13:43,658
NUR ⟨aza⟩ bazukh, ⟨hob ikh⟩ gevoynt ober nit tsuzamen.

287
00:13:44,119 --> 00:13:46,576
un vi lang zent ir geven in militer?

288
00:13:47,427 --> 00:13:48,990
tsvey yor denst-

289
00:13:51,308 --> 00:13:52,432
ts- tsi merer

290
00:13:52,793 --> 00:13:55,875
UNK geven ⟨in⟩ KIBUTS iz oykh geven militer.

291
00:13:57,130 --> 00:13:59,857
un vos iz gevorn mitn dritn bruder demolts?

292
00:13:59,830 --> 00:14:03,064
un der iz, hob ikh nokh dem gehert

293
00:14:03,222 --> 00:14:05,410
az zey zenen fun Tshernovits

294
00:14:06,259 --> 00:14:08,379
NACH Bukarest gekumen

295
00:14:08,571 --> 00:14:11,029
un ikh fleg bakumen ⟨ALSO⟩

296
00:14:11,592 --> 00:14:14,201
gants veynik NACHTRICHTEN fun

297
00:14:14,258 --> 00:14:17,188
LEUTE vos zenen avek, oder ikh veys vi azoy

298
00:14:18,578 --> 00:14:22,655
un nokh hob ikh gehert az m'hot im EINGESPERRT fun, s'iz geven

299
00:14:22,847 --> 00:14:25,119
ale tsienistishe

300
00:14:25,362 --> 00:14:30,098
makhers hot men in Rumenye EINGESPERRT in, in GEFANGNIS, un im oykh.

301
00:14:31,572 --> 00:14:32,831
in a tog

302
00:14:33,023 --> 00:14:37,640
ze ikh a- in a tsaytung, dos iz di tsaytung fun di religyeze

303
00:14:37,917 --> 00:14:42,737
az DAG HAMMARSKJOLD, der UNRRA SEKRETAR UNK, ⟨DEN⟩

304
00:14:43,165 --> 00:14:44,171
hot zikh

305
00:14:45,139 --> 00:14:47,971
arayngemisht. er hot aroysgenumen dem rebn

306
00:14:47,971 --> 00:14:49,791
fun GEFANGNIS

307
00:14:51,535 --> 00:14:57,688
un er iz ongekumen NACH BELGIEN oyfn veg NACH Amerike. azoy WAR geshribn.

308
00:14:58,386 --> 00:15:02,784
bin ikh gelofn vi a meshugener tsu di REDAKTION. kh'hob gevolt

309
00:15:03,330 --> 00:15:07,138
visn tsi mayn bruder iz oykh mit di, in, in di familye.

310
00:15:07,819 --> 00:15:12,689
un mit UNK tsu telefonirn in yene tsaytn iz geven zeyer shver. kh'hob

311
00:15:12,689 --> 00:15:14,049
JEMANDEN dort

312
00:15:14,299 --> 00:15:19,608
in telefon getrofn, hot er mir gezogt mayn bruder Hershl iz oykh d- ⟨vest krign⟩ a

313
00:15:20,458 --> 00:15:21,650
a briv

314
00:15:22,028 --> 00:15:27,506
un azoy hot er ongehoybn tsu shikn mir briv, un nokh hot er geshikt a bild. ikh hob nisht gevust vi er zet oys

315
00:15:27,951 --> 00:15:28,839
un

316
00:15:29,048 --> 00:15:33,446
in ershtn peysekh, in a peysekh WAR dos, ikh gedenk nisht voser yor

317
00:15:33,452 --> 00:15:36,267
zenen zey gekumen oyf peysekh keyn Yisroel.

318
00:15:36,267 --> 00:15:38,964
s'iz geven a groyse simkhe, un

319
00:15:39,055 --> 00:15:40,702
in FLU- in

320
00:15:41,181 --> 00:15:44,381
in FLUGHAFEN, s'iz geven toyznter khasidim.

321
00:15:44,387 --> 00:15:47,570
undz ze'mir geven di kinder vos zenen mir geven baym rov

322
00:15:47,678 --> 00:15:49,188
di eyntsike on

323
00:15:49,188 --> 00:15:50,738
BARTE un peyes

324
00:15:50,738 --> 00:15:54,558
un undz ze'mir geven di, di g- mekhutonim. ikh perzenlekh

325
00:15:55,002 --> 00:15:59,265
nokh hob ikh gezen mayn bruder, azoy vi ikh hob aykh getsaygt a b- oyfn bild

326
00:16:00,132 --> 00:16:02,758
a, a yingl mit a bord. ikh hob im

327
00:16:03,625 --> 00:16:08,226
gelozt als a, a pitsl kind mit dray yorn. oyf eyn mol ze ikh

328
00:16:08,721 --> 00:16:11,415
a yingl mit a bord mit peyes.

329
00:16:11,050 --> 00:16:13,372
er iz geblibn bay dem rebn?

330
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:15,499
baym rebn, un hot oyfgevaksn azoy.

331
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:16,579
un

332
00:16:16,939 --> 00:16:19,734
der rebe hot im oyfgenumen als kind?

333
00:16:20,263 --> 00:16:21,320
yetst

334
00:16:21,681 --> 00:16:26,082
ot dos hob ikh fargesn tsu zogn. shoyn ven undz ze'mir geven in Bukarest

335
00:16:26,082 --> 00:16:28,660
iz der rebe oykh shoyn geven in Bukarest

336
00:16:28,988 --> 00:16:31,685
un ikh hob UNK im tsvey mol ENTFUHRT.

337
00:16:31,685 --> 00:16:35,141
kh'hob im avekGENOMMEN mit nokh a por ⟨yunge⟩ kinder

338
00:16:35,164 --> 00:16:36,879
tsu undz in kinder heym

339
00:16:37,695 --> 00:16:42,054
ober in kinder heym hob ikh nisht gehat keyn makht. ⟨ikh bin oykh⟩ geven kleyn, hot men undz

340
00:16:42,054 --> 00:16:44,423
farmakht, un m'hot im tsurikgebrengt.

341
00:16:44,513 --> 00:16:47,882
nokh a monat tsvey hob ikh im nokh a mol avekgenumen.

342
00:16:48,124 --> 00:16:50,736
ikh hob nisht gekent dos farTRAGEN

343
00:16:50,736 --> 00:16:52,252
biz hayntikn tog.

344
00:16:53,085 --> 00:16:54,986
az er iz bay dem rebn?

345
00:16:53,102 --> 00:16:53,973
az

346
00:16:54,283 --> 00:16:57,044
az er i- iz bay fremde.

347
00:16:55,785 --> 00:16:57,028
un nisht

348
00:16:58,890 --> 00:17:01,179
un der rebe hot im adoptirt?

349
00:17:00,780 --> 00:17:04,486
yo, hot im ales zeyer gut, yo, d-

350
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,271
ho-

351
00:17:04,594 --> 00:17:07,575
ober dos hot mikh PERSONLICH

352
00:17:09,150 --> 00:17:12,637
un der rebe hot im, ot, ot dem nomen fun dem rebn hot er?

353
00:17:11,766 --> 00:17:15,827
ot dem nomen funem rebn. er heyst Hershl Portugal

354
00:17:15,968 --> 00:17:17,430
un nisht Leder.

355
00:17:18,194 --> 00:17:23,301
un nokh iz er geven in Yisroel a tsvey vokhn, fleg mikh trefn mit im yedn tog

356
00:17:23,545 --> 00:17:25,766
nokh UNK zenen zey geforn keyn Amerike.

357
00:17:26,295 --> 00:17:28,533
fun Amerike fleg ikh hobn kontakt

358
00:17:29,333 --> 00:17:32,111
a briv oder telefon

359
00:17:33,906 --> 00:17:35,418
UND

360
00:17:39,801 --> 00:17:44,194
azoy oyf eyn mol shraybt, shikt er mir a briv, er iz ge- er hot khasene.

361
00:17:44,503 --> 00:17:49,579
dernokh hot er khasene gehat, un, un nokh hob ikh gehert yedes mol a- az s'iz do a kind.

362
00:17:49,579 --> 00:17:51,601
er hot gehat akht kinder.

363
00:17:52,249 --> 00:17:54,639
in nayntsn finef un akhtsik

364
00:17:55,185 --> 00:17:58,160
bin ikh geforn mit mayn gantse familye

365
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,583
keyn Amerike.

366
00:17:59,607 --> 00:18:01,238
ikh hob im BESUCHT.

367
00:18:02,644 --> 00:18:03,482
un

368
00:18:03,741 --> 00:18:07,667
di familye zayne, di froy un di groyse kinder shoyn

369
00:18:07,707 --> 00:18:10,941
hobn gevolt visn di STORY f-

370
00:18:11,217 --> 00:18:15,632
fun mayn bruder, vayl er hot nisht gevust. er hot nokh nisht gezogt.

371
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:21,521
ober er hot shoyn o- er hot nisht fargesn z- vern er iz kleyn geven az UNK bruder.

372
00:18:21,493 --> 00:18:24,738
er, endlekh efsher nisht, vayl dos hob ikh

373
00:18:24,738 --> 00:18:25,566
IMMER

374
00:18:25,566 --> 00:18:29,368
ven ikh hob gehat tsayt, ven ikh WAR UNK dos arayngeredt

375
00:18:29,998 --> 00:18:34,160
ober nokh dem, di zibetsn yor vos ikh hob im nisht gezen, dos iz

376
00:18:34,318 --> 00:18:36,101
iz groys gevorn

377
00:18:36,748 --> 00:18:38,581
er hot yo gevust

378
00:18:38,942 --> 00:18:42,226
vayl ven er hot khasene gehat, hot er gegebn di kinder

379
00:18:42,233 --> 00:18:45,416
NAHME nokh mayn tate un nokh di mame.

380
00:18:45,827 --> 00:18:47,559
dos hot er yo gemakht.

381
00:18:48,139 --> 00:18:51,187
fun vu er hot gevust veys ikh oykh nisht.

382
00:18:52,864 --> 00:18:57,633
vi iz yetst aykh gegangen in Yisroel? vos hot ir getun in Yisroel?

383
00:18:56,779 --> 00:18:59,506
gearbet oyf a traktor. ikh bin geven a

384
00:19:00,508 --> 00:19:03,067
in a oranzhn PLANTATIE

385
00:19:03,664 --> 00:19:05,058
nokhn militer.

386
00:19:06,145 --> 00:19:09,598
oykh geven aleyn, on keynem nisht un nisht

387
00:19:09,790 --> 00:19:11,674
nisht gelekt keyn honik

388
00:19:12,085 --> 00:19:14,019
nokh hob ikh bakumen gelt

389
00:19:15,190 --> 00:19:17,732
bin ikh aroysgeforn. ikh hob GENOMMEN

390
00:19:17,805 --> 00:19:23,621
dakht zikh dray oder fir monat urloyb OHNE BEZAHLUNG, ⟨zenen mir⟩ aroysgeforn NACH Eyrope.

391
00:19:24,387 --> 00:19:26,375
un azoy iz gevorn f-

392
00:19:26,375 --> 00:19:28,518
fun fir monat iz gevorn

393
00:19:28,518 --> 00:19:30,219
iber draysik yor.

394
00:19:32,065 --> 00:19:34,708
⟨ets zent⟩ nisht mer tsurikgeforn keyn Yisroel?

395
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:37,360
BESUCH yo, ober

396
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,555
tsu blaybn

397
00:19:39,017 --> 00:19:43,145
nisht. ikh bin geforn keyn Yisroel. nokh dem hob ikh geheyrat in Yisroel.

398
00:19:43,388 --> 00:19:44,934
ven hot ir khasene gehat?

399
00:19:44,738 --> 00:19:46,386
in nayntsn zibetsik.

400
00:19:47,995 --> 00:19:51,617
in nayntsn eyn un zibetsik iz geboyrn mayn ershter zun

401
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:54,320
bin ikh oykh geforn keyn Yisroel, vayl mayn froy

402
00:19:54,320 --> 00:19:59,092
hot gevolt dem ershtn SOHN, di eltern ire, er zol geboyrn in Yisroel.

403
00:20:01,933 --> 00:20:03,440
zent ir gekumen

404
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,729
keyn DEUTSCHLAND?

405
00:20:04,718 --> 00:20:05,657
yo.

406
00:20:05,207 --> 00:20:07,361
ven zent ir ongekumen keyn DEUTSCHLAND?

407
00:20:07,013 --> 00:20:10,247
in VIERTn februar, DREIUNDSECHZIG

408
00:20:10,995 --> 00:20:12,271
NACH Minkhn.

409
00:20:14,421 --> 00:20:16,474
UNK gearbet in Minkhn

410
00:20:16,564 --> 00:20:21,890
in B.M.W., un nokh hot men mir gezogt "vos broykhstu in a fabrik? kum arbet in a

411
00:20:22,403 --> 00:20:23,865
a lokal."

412
00:20:24,192 --> 00:20:28,168
bin ikh gegangen NACH KITZINGEN AM MAIN. dos iz bay WURZBURG.

413
00:20:28,292 --> 00:20:31,053
dort hob ikh gearbet FAST ZEHN JAHR

414
00:20:31,397 --> 00:20:34,614
nokh hot men mikh GENOMMEN in a shtot ANSBACH

415
00:20:35,498 --> 00:20:37,604
un fun dort bin ikh nokh

416
00:20:37,604 --> 00:20:41,567
a yor bin ikh gevorn zelbst shtendik. di balebos hot mir gegebn

417
00:20:41,927 --> 00:20:43,721
dos gesheft, ⟨bin⟩ ikh

418
00:20:43,721 --> 00:20:45,870
geven dort aleyn zelbst shtendik.

419
00:20:46,011 --> 00:20:48,519
un vi lang di amerikaner zenen geven

420
00:20:48,576 --> 00:20:51,877
iz geven parnose. di amerikaner zenen avekgegangen

421
00:20:51,900 --> 00:20:56,146
hob ikh NUR gelt farloyrn. ikh hob nokh gelozt, m'hot mikh in gantsn dort

422
00:20:57,604 --> 00:21:02,722
in ANSBACH zent ir tsufelik geven. iz dort geven epes yidn? tsi lebn dortn yidn?

423
00:21:01,620 --> 00:21:03,301
keyner nisht, neyn.

424
00:21:04,422 --> 00:21:06,610
ir hot mit a mol dertseylt fun a shul.

425
00:21:06,666 --> 00:21:10,130
s'iz DA a zeyer sheyne shul. di iz geborn gevorn

426
00:21:10,130 --> 00:21:13,359
kh'hob aykh getsaygt, ikh ken aykh tsaygn dos bild fun di shul.

427
00:21:13,737 --> 00:21:15,165
ir hot dos gezen?

428
00:21:15,643 --> 00:21:19,434
dos iz geborn gevorn in zibetsn hundert zeks un fuftsik.

429
00:21:21,010 --> 00:21:23,484
un di shul iz geblibn vayl

430
00:21:23,727 --> 00:21:31,753
di iz in STADT MITTE, un di hot men nisht farbrent, vayl se volt di gantse STADT gegangen, di gantse STRASSE

431
00:21:32,468 --> 00:21:38,115
nor ICH hob gehat a shlisl tsu, anfang, ven s'WAREN amerikaner statsyonirt in ANSBACH

432
00:21:38,627 --> 00:21:40,325
WAR di shul nokh

433
00:21:40,770 --> 00:21:42,080
in bavegung.

434
00:21:40,770 --> 00:21:42,941
zenen gekumen mentshn.

435
00:21:42,441 --> 00:21:44,713
yo. der, vayl der

436
00:21:44,905 --> 00:21:49,961
rabiner fun di armey in DEUTSCHLAND hot GEWOHNT in ANSBACH

437
00:21:51,503 --> 00:21:53,640
